Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: audit DSP START/STOP with PAs and clocks off

Require the full PA-off marker set and graph-local mute proof. Token-match
START/STOP, repeat hardware/mute checks, always attempt STOP, and never
let the ALSA PCM start or write data. One attempt per APM lifetime.

